correctness[shared-fill]: every element of `fill(zeros(3), 4)` is same object
 --> positive.jl:1:8
  |
1 | grid = fill(zeros(3), 4)
  |        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ one object shared by all slots
  |             -------- evaluated once
  |
  = why: mutating one element changes all of them
  = confidence: possible
  = fix: replace with `[zeros(3) for _ in 1:4]`   [likely]
  = docs: corset explain shared-fill

